          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " answered Jesus. So Peter got out of the boat and started walking on the water to Jesus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when he noticed the strong wind, he was afraid and started to sink down in the water. “Save me, Lord!” he cried.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
