          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They both got into the boat, and the wind died down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the disciples in the boat worshipped Jesus. “Truly you are the Son of God!” they exclaimed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
